{"script":"sj_036_01","des":"贝尔卡-对我们的营地感觉如何？","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1a","y":-248,"mirrow":false,"x":250,"scaleY":1,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1a","y":-248,"mirrow":false,"x":250,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]真是令人难忘的营地，比大市集的旅馆还要棒！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]见识到你们的营地之后，我已经开始怀疑商会的旅店究竟有什么脸面跟客人收钱了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]虽然说我在环会里干的是实地探查，经常做到处跑的事务，却没怎么跑过太远的地方。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]不知道世界上的其他地方有没有更棒的住处，但是你们营地给我留下的印象，怕是忘不掉啦。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]完了，这下更向往冒险家的生活了，真想早点出去体验更多心潮澎湃的经历啊。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]嗯，冒险家是我的志向！我一直对广阔的世界很感兴趣！看看，这次只是比平时稍微跑远了一点点，就见识到了这么令人开心的新景色。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]我听说你也游历过世界许多地方……如果有机会，能不能带我一起呢！当然，是要在工作告一段落之后啦！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]啊，我已经迫不及待能经历更多更多刺激的冒险了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}]}